            <abstract>
                <p>Magic prayer for expelling demons, to be recited by a child. It uses ʾasmāt, which are similar to Arabic names for God 
                    (<foreign xml:lang="ar">ʾila</foreign>, <foreign xml:lang="ar">ʾAllāh</foreign>).</p>
